# The Python reconstruction service lives here but deploys separately (Fly).
# Vercel must not upload it: it is ~500MB, it contains patient scan data under
# local-data/, and none of it is part of the Next.js build.
#
# Gitignore already keeps the heavy parts out of the repo, so a git-integration
# deploy never sees them — this covers a `vercel` CLI deploy from a local
# checkout, which uploads the working directory.
soleiq-foot-ai/
